<title>USA: U.S. DLA sold 20 tonnes stockpile tin.</title>
<headline>U.S. DLA sold 20 tonnes stockpile tin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 20 tonnes of stockpile tin at $2.7275 per lb in its daily offering Tuesday to Ney Smelting, Brooklyn, N.Y.</p>
